# Tracer: inspect the evidence connecting a declaration and two inequalities.
#
# Before: the same source verified, but there was no reading export or browser.
# have x R
# 0 <= x ^ 2
# 1 <= x ^ 2 + 1
#
# Now: source for the reading JSON, browser and static-export acceptance gates.
have x R
0 <= x ^ 2
1 <= x ^ 2 + 1
#
# Boundary: the reader shows the selected evidence, not every possible proof.
# Verification: target/release/litex -strict -f examples/reading/linked_facts.lit
# Reading acceptance: target/release/litex -reading -json -f examples/reading/linked_facts.lit
